 ## Money
 
 Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its
-price divided by 12.
+price divided by 12. The monthly cost of a weekly plan is its price multiplied by 52 and divided by 12.
 
